# omarchy-atomic — GUI user applications delivered via Flatpak (Flathub)
# Format: one Flatpak app-id per line. Installed onto the writable layer, NOT
# baked into the immutable base image.
#
# IDs marked "TODO verify" need confirming against Flathub before first use.

